<section aria-label="Fedi a Bottega" class="ab-section" id="fedi-a-bottega">
<p class="ab-kicker">Fedi a Bottega</p>
<h2 class="ab-title">Make your wedding bands and learn how they are made.</h2>
<p class="ab-subtitle">You work at the Old Bench yourselves, inside a real working goldsmith’s workshop. I guide you step by step: you take home not only the rings, but the process too.</p>
<div class="ab-cta-row" style="margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px;">
<a class="ab-cta secondary" href="#faq-fedi">Fedi a Bottega FAQ · price, time, how it works</a>
</div>
<a class="zoomable-img" href="assets/ab_fedi_manifesto.png" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="Open image full screen"><img alt="Fedi a Bottega manifesto" class="ab-poster" src="assets/ab_fedi_manifesto.png"/></a>
<div class="ab-steps">
<div class="ab-step"><div class="ab-num">01</div><div><h4>No previous experience needed.</h4><p>You come in not knowing how to do it. You leave with your wedding bands and the process you learned.</p></div></div>
<div class="ab-step"><div class="ab-num">02</div><div><h4>One bench. One seat.</h4><p>One guest works at the bench while the other stays beside them and watches. Then you swap. I follow every step, constantly.</p></div></div>
<div class="ab-step"><div class="ab-num">03</div><div><h4>The wedding bands stay. So does the technique.</h4><p>The process remains yours: you can use it again to create other rings of the same kind and endless variations.</p></div></div>
</div>
<a class="zoomable-img" href="assets/ab_fedi_metodo.jpg" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="Open image full screen"><img alt="Fedi a Bottega · one bench, one seat, work and guidance" class="ab-poster" src="assets/ab_fedi_metodo.jpg"/></a>
<div class="ab-tiles">
<a class="zoomable-img" href="assets/ab_fedi_idea.png" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="Open image full screen"><img alt="From the idea to the finished wedding band" src="assets/ab_fedi_idea.png"/></a>
<a class="zoomable-img" href="assets/ab_fedi_un_banco.jpg" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="Open image full screen"><img alt="One person at the Old Bench, guided step by step" src="assets/ab_fedi_un_banco.jpg"/></a>
<a class="zoomable-img" href="assets/ab_fedi_gesto.png" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="Open image full screen"><img alt="Every couple. Every gesture. Every ring is different." src="assets/ab_fedi_gesto.png"/></a>
<a class="zoomable-img" href="assets/ab_fedi_classica.png" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="Open image full screen"><img alt="Classic forms, engravings, organic textures" src="assets/ab_fedi_classica.png"/></a>
<a class="zoomable-img" href="assets/ab_fedi_classica_oro.png" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="Open image full screen"><img alt="Even the classic wedding band" src="assets/ab_fedi_classica_oro.png"/></a>
<a class="zoomable-img" href="assets/ab_fedi_cover.png" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="Open image full screen"><img alt="No previous experience needed" src="assets/ab_fedi_cover.png"/></a>
</div>
<p class="ab-note"><strong>The promise is simple:</strong> make your wedding bands and learn how they are made.</p>
<div class="ab-cta-row">
<a class="ab-cta" href="https://wa.me/393482762842">Ask on WhatsApp</a>
</div>
</section>
<div class="faq-new" id="faq-fedi" style="scroll-margin-top:84px; margin:26px 0 30px;">
<h3 style="font-size:22px; margin:0 0 14px;">FEDI A BOTTEGA · FAQ</h3>
<div class="faq-item">
<h3 class="faq-q">F1 · Why are places so limited?</h3>
<div class="faq-a"><strong>We do not need to fill a classroom.<br/>We do not have a classroom.<br/>We have a bench. One seat, at Campo de’ Fiori, in the very heart of Rome: hard to replicate elsewhere.</strong><br/><br/><strong>One guest works at the bench while the other stays beside them and watches. Then you swap. I follow every move, from start to finish.</strong><br/><br/><strong>That is why we can necessarily welcome only a limited number of couples each year.</strong><br/><br/><strong>All the attention, every time, on one person.</strong></div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item">
<h3 class="faq-q">F2 · Is it expensive? Yes. Is it overpriced? No.</h3>
<div class="faq-a"><strong>Yes. Fedi a Bottega costs more than a pair of wedding bands made directly by me.</strong><br/><br/><strong>And it should cost more: teaching a craft takes more time than doing the job.</strong><br/><br/>If what you want is simply a pair of wedding bands at the lowest possible price, do not choose Fedi a Bottega: <strong>I can make them for you.</strong> It is simpler, faster and costs less.<br/><br/>Here you have a real working goldsmith’s workshop, the Old Bench, the tools and my time at your disposal. One person works at the bench at a time: every step is explained, shown, carried out by you, checked and, when necessary, done again.<br/><br/><strong>The cost is not the same for every couple.</strong> Before defining it, we need to understand what kind of wedding bands you want to make, which metal we will use, which processes will be needed and how much workshop time the method will require. That is why we always talk first, either by phone or directly at the workshop.<br/><br/>As a reference, for a pair of simple wedding bands <strong>the cost generally comes to around €900 per pair, materials excluded.</strong><br/><br/>You pay for the workshop time required for you to genuinely learn to make them yourselves. In the end, you will have <strong>the wedding bands, the method and the practice.</strong><br/><br/><strong>So yes, it costs more. But no: it is not overpriced.</strong></div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item">
<h3 class="faq-q">F3 · Is it romantic? Very.<br/>Is it an aperitivo? No!</h3>
<div class="faq-a"><strong>It is not a classroom. It is not an aperitivo. It is not a party. It is not a demonstration.</strong><br/><br/><strong>You come here to work.</strong><br/><br/>At the Old Bench, you are the ones making your wedding bands. I teach you the process, show you the gestures, guide you and step in when needed.<br/><br/><strong>You do not come to watch me make your wedding bands: you come to make them yourselves.</strong></div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item">
<h3 class="faq-q">F4 · Do you need experience? No. You need to want to learn.</h3>
<div class="faq-a">No previous experience is required. This is not an exam.<br/><br/><strong>But it is not a passive activity either.</strong><br/><br/>We define the project together before starting and I guide you step by step at the Old Bench. If you only want to watch, <strong>Fedi a Bottega is not the right method for you.</strong></div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item">
<h3 class="faq-q">F5 · What do you take away besides the wedding bands?</h3>
<div class="faq-a"><strong>Your wedding bands are your first project.<br/>The wedding bands stay with you. So does the technique.</strong><br/><br/>You make them yourselves and take away not only the rings, but the basic process you have learned. By changing the section, width, thickness, proportions, finish or texture, you can use it to conceive and make a practically endless family of variations on the same ring.<br/><br/><strong>That is the difference between buying two wedding bands and doing Fedi a Bottega.</strong></div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item">
<h3 class="faq-q">F6 · This is not a last-minute activity.</h3>
<div class="faq-a"><strong>Your wedding bands take time because you really make them yourselves.</strong><br/><br/>Fedi a Bottega may require several sessions and, depending on the project, weeks or months between bench work, possible castings, corrections and finishing.<br/><br/><strong>One person works at the Old Bench at a time.</strong> There are two of you and you alternate: while one works, the other stays beside them and watches. Then you swap. I follow every step, constantly.<br/><br/><strong>If you are looking for something to organise at the last minute, it is better to let me make the wedding bands for you.</strong></div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item">
<h3 class="faq-q">F7 · How do we define the project and the exact price?</h3>
<div class="faq-a">Before we begin, let’s talk: <a class="faq-wa-link" href="https://wa.me/393482762842">book a call or a visit to the workshop</a>, so we can define the design, metal, difficulty, timing and cost.<br/><br/>If the project is not suitable for you to make yourselves, <strong>I will tell you.</strong> If it makes more sense for me to make it, <strong>I will tell you that too.</strong></div>
</div>
</div>

<section aria-label="Crea a Bottega" class="ab-section" id="crea-a-bottega">
<p class="ab-kicker">Crea a Bottega</p>
<div class="crea-title-wrap"><h2 class="ab-title">Your jewel,<br class="ab-title-break"/>made by you. <span class="course-question">Is it a course?</span></h2></div>
<p class="ab-subtitle">I do not call it a course. Every jewel has different needs. I call it Crea a Bottega: guided, made-to-measure work to arrive at a personal jewel, conceived by you or suggested by me, explained step by step and made by you here in the workshop.</p>
<a class="zoomable-img" href="assets/ab_crea_gabriele_01.png" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="Apri immagine a schermo intero"><img alt="Gente a Bottega · Gabriele · Il mio primo anello" class="ab-poster" src="assets/ab_crea_gabriele_01.png"/></a>
<div class="ab-steps">
<div class="ab-step"><div class="ab-num">01</div><div><h4>We start from an idea.</h4><p>It can be yours, it can start from zero, it can take inspiration from one of my jewels, or from a project I suggest and guide you through.</p></div></div>
<div class="ab-step"><div class="ab-num">02</div><div><h4>You work at the Old Bench.</h4><p>I guide you through the steps.</p></div></div>
<div class="ab-step"><div class="ab-num">03</div><div><h4>It is not an exercise.</h4><p>The goal is to arrive at a personal, solid, beautiful jewel, born from a real process.</p></div></div>
</div>
